{"id":"e9a7a559c91dc7f1","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-ideal-ideal-covering.md","title":"ZFC Ideal Ideal Covering","display":"df-zfc-ideal-ideal-covering — ZFC Ideal Ideal Covering","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal-ideal-covering","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal-ideal-covering"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal-ideal-covering — ZFC Ideal Ideal Covering","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ideal]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal-ideal-covering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal-ideal-covering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal-ideal-covering — ZFC Ideal Ideal Covering"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal I,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal I,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdealIdealCovering}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdealIdealCovering}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对非空序数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min C\">\\(\\min C\\)</span> 为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)\">\\(m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)\\)</span> 的唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>；此记号仅在其非空域使用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}covering}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcIdealIdealCovering}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal I,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\exists\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal I\\;(\\bigcup\\mathcal A=X)\\land\\kappa=\\min\\{\\lvert\\mathcal A\\rvert:\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal I\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal A=X\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}covering}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcIdealIdealCovering}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal I,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\exists\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal I\\;(\\bigcup\\mathcal A=X)\\land\\kappa=\\min\\{\\lvert\\mathcal A\\rvert:\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal I\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal A=X\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The covering number is defined only when members of the ideal cover the underlying set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ideal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal I,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcIdealIdealCovering}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\min C","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)","display":fa